from pathlib import Path
import json, statistics
base=Path('docs/experiments/ARXIV_LIMIT_FINAL_2026-09-16')
web=[]
for interval in [8,6,4,2]:
 v=json.loads((base/f'metrics/web-{interval}.json').read_text());m=v['scheduler_metrics'];physical=[e for e in m['events'] if e['event_type']=='physical_request'];intervals=[e['previous_request_interval_ms'] for e in physical if e['previous_request_interval_ms'] is not None]
 web.append(dict(min_interval_seconds=interval,queries=len(v['cases']),hit_queries=sum(c['classification']=='VALID_HIT' for c in v['cases']),physical_requests=len(physical),http_200=m['http_200_count'],failed_queries=sum(c['classification']=='PROVIDER_FAILED' for c in v['cases']),retry_count=m['retry_count'],interval_violations=m['interval_violation_count'],minimum_observed_interval_ms=min(intervals),sum_query_elapsed_seconds=sum(c['elapsed_seconds'] for c in v['cases']),median_http_elapsed_ms=statistics.median(e['elapsed_ms'] for e in physical),runtime_dir=v['runtime_dir']))
(base/'metrics/web.json').write_text(json.dumps(dict(runs=web,selected_default_seconds=8,reason='All 32 queries succeeded, but sequential repeated-query runs are small and potentially cache-warmed; insufficient evidence for a lower default.'),ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n')
api=json.loads((base/'metrics/api.json').read_text());m=api['scheduler_metrics'];runtime=json.loads((Path(api['runtime_dir'])/'summary.json').read_text())['provider_requests']
(base/'api-smoke.md').write_text(f'''# API smoke\n\n沿用 `scripts/arxiv_batch_smoke.py --transport api --max-concurrency 4`。\n\n- 本次出口 API 正常：known ID、英文标题、10-ID metadata batch 均成功。严格主题查询返回 HTTP 200 / 真实零结果。另四个并发逻辑请求（两次主题检索、两次 metadata）全部成功。\n- 逻辑请求 {m['logical_api_requests']}；物理请求 {m['physical_api_requests']}；HTTP 200 {m['http_200_count']}；429 {m['http_429_count']}；retry {m['retry_count']}；interval violation {m['interval_violation_count']}。\n- Runtime Debug 记录 {runtime['logical_api_requests']} 个 logical / {runtime['physical_api_requests']} 个 physical，与 scheduler 一致。\n- 当前未复现真实 429；429 / Retry-After / budget / circuit 均以离线 fake HTTP 验证，不能推断出口以后不会再次限流。\n- [完整指标](metrics/api.json)；Runtime 路径见 JSON 的 `runtime_dir`。早期 smoke 暴露线程上下文和 API logical event 漏记，均已修复，历史运行保留在 runtime/api 和 runtime/api-complete。\n''')
rows='\n'.join(f"| {r['min_interval_seconds']} | {r['hit_queries']}/8 | {r['failed_queries']} | {r['retry_count']} | {r['minimum_observed_interval_ms']:.1f} | {r['sum_query_elapsed_seconds']:.2f} |" for r in web)
(base/'web-smoke.md').write_text('''# Web smoke\n\n每档串行执行同一组 8 个公开英文主题，按 8 → 6 → 4 → 2 秒顺序执行。各档独立进程，档间等待 8 秒。\n\n| 配置间隔(s) | 返回候选 | 故障 | 重试 | 最小实际间隔(ms) | 查询累计耗时(s) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n'''+rows+'''\n\n共 32 次主题检索，32 次 HTTP 200，每次返回 5 个 SearchHit；网络错误被错记为 EMPTY 的次数为 0（真实运行未发生网络错误，分类故障路径另外以离线测试验证）。每个实际请求均写入现有 Runtime Debug。\n\n默认保持 **8 秒**。2 秒小样本没有失败，但查询顺序固定、重复查询可能使后续档位命中缓存，不能把本实验视为长期容量证明或无偏性能比较。不存在自动切换 transport。\n\n[汇总指标](metrics/web.json)，各档完整事件见 metrics/web-{8,6,4,2}.json。\n''')
